===Etymology===
From {{confix|en|electro|phoresis}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Flame, not lame-electrophoresis.wav|a=US|bad=misreading}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|electrophoreses}}

# {{lb|en|electricity}} the [[migration]] of [[electrically]] [[charge]]d [[molecule]]s through a [[medium]] under the [[influence]] of an [[electric]] [[field]]
# {{lb|en|analytical chemistry}} ([[biochemistry|''biochemistry'']]),  a [[method]] for the [[separation]] and [[analysis]] of large [[molecule]]s (such as [[protein]]s) by migrating a [[colloidal]] [[solution]] of them through a [[gel]]; [[gel electrophoresis]]

